OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,6,Fsunny spells and some cloud. A risk of
OL,7,Fsome rain arriving into the far west
OL,8,Flater. Feeling slightly warmer,
OL,9,Fparticularly in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FTurning unsettled midweek, with spells
OL,13,Fof rain and showers. Some heavy rain
OL,14,Fand thunderstorms are possible at
OL,15,Ftimes but also some drier and sunnier
OL,16,Fspells. Warmer and more humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
